  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>How to choose your sizeOur sizing buttons list the Women's size first (W) and the equivalent Big Kids' size second (K)Ex. If you usually wear a Big Kids' size 5.5, select the button with W 7 / K 5.5If only one size is listed, select your typical women's size.Product Features Hairy suede upper with knit side panels\nLow-profile silhouette for sleek style\nLow-profile silhouette for sleek style\nPadded collar offers additional comfort\nFloral pattern insole and tongue detail with metallic gold charm chain along lateral collar\nLightweight cushioned midsole offers long-lasting relief underfoot\nPerforations at toebox for increased ventilation\nRubber outsole with classic hoops pivot circle provides reliable grip across surfaces\nClassic ace closure secures the fit\nThe Nike Dunk Low SE is imported.\nThese Women's Nike Dunk Low SE Casual Shoes are a rework of the iconic Dunk, designed strictly for sneakerheads with a soft spot for romance. Crafted with hairy suede uppers and knit side paneling, this special edition silhouette features a gold charm chain along the collar and \"Now Accepting All Flowers\" floral pattern detailing—a subtle reminder to cherish the love you're given when it comes to you.</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's Nike Dunk Low SE Casual Shoes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Sizing Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Adult</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 1